#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid ""
"Given a general exponential form of y = b*m^x for a curve fit, calculates b "
"if TRUE or forces b to be 1 and only calculates the m values if FALSE."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອມີຮູບແບບເລກກຳລັງທົ່ວໄປ y = b*m^x ສຳລັບເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ, ຈະຄິດໄລ່ b ຖ້າເປັນ TRUE ຫຼື ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ b "
"ເປັນ 1 ແລະ ຄິດໄລ່ສະເພາະຄ່າ m ຖ້າເປັນ FALSE."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid ""
"Given a general linear form of y = m*x+b for a curve fit, calculates b if "
"TRUE or forces b to be 0 and only calculates the m values if FALSE, i.e. "
"forces the curve fit to pass through the origin."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອມີຮູບແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ທົ່ວໄປ y = m*x+b ສຳລັບເສັ້ນຊື່, ຈະຄິດໄລ່ b ຖ້າເປັນ TRUE ຫຼື ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ b ເປັນ 0 "
"ແລະ ຄິດໄລ່ສະເພາະຄ່າ m ຖ້າເປັນ FALSE, ເຊິ່ງຄືການບັງຄັບໃຫ້ເສັ້ນຜ່ານຈຸດກຳເນີດ (0,0)."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid ""
"Given partial data about a linear trend, calculates various parameters about "
"the ideal linear trend using the least-squares method."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອມີຂໍ້ມູນບາງສ່ວນກ່ຽວກັບທ່າອ່ຽງເສັ້ນຊື່, ຈະຄິດໄລ່ພາຣາມິເຕີຕ່າງໆ "
"ກ່ຽວກັບທ່າອ່ຽງເສັ້ນຊື່ທີ່ເໝາະສົມໂດຍໃຊ້ວິທີກຳລັງສອງນ້ອຍສຸດ."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid ""
"Given partial data about an exponential growth curve, calculates various "
"parameters about the best fit ideal exponential growth curve."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອມີຂໍ້ມູນບາງສ່ວນກ່ຽວກັບເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງການເຕີບໂຕແບບເລກກຳລັງ, ຈະຄິດໄລ່ພາຣາມິເຕີຕ່າງໆ "
"ກ່ຽວກັບເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງການເຕີບໂຕແບບເລກກຳລັງທີ່ເໝາະສົມທີ່ສຸດ."

