msgstr "ປ່ຽນແທນທັງໝົດ"

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "Replace text in a string based on the supplied regular expression."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນແທນຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນສະຕຣິງ ໂດຍອີງຕາມ regular expression ທີ່ລະບຸ."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "Replaces existing text with new text in a string."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນແທນຂໍ້ຄວາມເດີມດ້ວຍຂໍ້ຄວາມໃໝ່ໃນສະຕຣິງ."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "Replaces part of a text string with different text."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນແທນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມດ້ວຍຂໍ້ຄວາມອື່ນ."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.xml:0
