msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າປັດຈຸບັນຂອງຕົວກັ່ນຕອງສະເປຣດຊີດກັບຄືນ."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/pivot/pivot_functions.js:0
msgid "Return the label of the current value of a spreadsheet filter."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນປ້າຍກຳກັບຂອງຄ່າປັດຈຸບັນຂອງຕົວກັ່ນຕອງສະເປຣດຊີດ."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "Return unique columns"
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຖັນທີ່ບໍ່ຊໍ້າກັນ"

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "Return unique rows"
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນແຖວທີ່ບໍ່ຊໍ້າກັນ"

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "Returns a cell reference as a string. "
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນການອ້າງອີງຕາກະໂລເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມ. "

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid ""
"Returns a filtered version of the source range, returning only rows or "
"columns that meet the specified conditions."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂອບເຂດຕົ້ນສະບັບທີ່ຖືກກັ່ນຕອງແລ້ວ ໂດຍສົ່ງຄືນສະເພາະແຖວ ຫຼື ຖັນທີ່ກົງຕາມເງື່ອນໄຂທີ່ລະບຸ."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "Returns a formula as a string."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນສູດຄິດໄລ່ເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "Returns a grid of random numbers between 0 inclusive and 1 exclusive."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຕາຕະລາງຕົວເລກສຸ່ມລະຫວ່າງ 0 (ຮວມທັງຄ່ານີ້) ຫາ 1 (ບໍ່ຮວມຄ່ານີ້)."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "Returns a n x n unit matrix, where n is the input dimension."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນມາຕຣິກຫົວໜ່ວຍຂະໜາດ n x n, ໂດຍທີ່ n ແມ່ນມິຕິທີ່ປ້ອນເຂົ້າ."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid ""
"Returns a range reference shifted by a specified number of rows and columns "
"from a starting cell reference."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນການອ້າງອີງຂອບເຂດທີ່ຖືກເລື່ອນໄປຕາມຈຳນວນແຖວ ແລະ ຖັນທີ່ກຳນົດ ຈາກຕາກະໂລເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "Returns a result array constrained to a specific width and height."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຜົນຮັບທີ່ຖືກຈຳກັດຕາມຄວາມກວ້າງ ແລະ ຄວາມສູງທີ່ລະບຸ."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "Returns a sequence of numbers."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລຳດັບຂອງຕົວເລກ."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid ""
"Returns a specified number of contiguous rows or columns from the start or "
"end of an array."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນແຖວ ຫຼື ຖັນທີ່ຕິດກັນຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດ ຈາກຕອນຕົ້ນ ຫຼື ຕອນທ້າຍຂອງອາເຣ."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid ""
"Returns a subtotal for a vertical range of cells using a specified "
"aggregation function."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຜົນລວມຍ່ອຍສຳລັບຂອບເຂດຕາກະໂລລວງຕັ້ງ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນການຮວບຮວມຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ລະບຸ."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "Returns a value by comparing cases to an expression."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າໂດຍການປຽບທຽບກໍລະນິດຕ່າງໆກັບນິພົດ."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "Returns a value depending on multiple logical expressions."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າຂຶ້ນກັບນິພົດຕັກກະສາດຫຼາຍອັນ."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid ""
"Returns an absolute reference as plain text of the top left cell in "
"reference."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນການອ້າງອີງແບບຕາຍຕົວເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດາ ຂອງຕາກະໂລເທິງຊ້າຍສຸດໃນການອ້າງອີງ."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "Returns an element from a list of choices based on index."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອົງປະກອບຈາກລາຍການຕົວເລືອກໂດຍອີງຕາມດັດຊະນີ."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "Returns opposite of provided logical value."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າກົງກັນຂ້າມຂອງຄ່າຕັກກະສາດທີ່ກຳນົດ."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "Returns text that occurs after a given substring or delimiter."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຢູ່ຫຼັງຂໍ້ຄວາມຍ່ອຍ ຫຼື ຕົວຂັ້ນທີ່ກຳນົດ."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
